1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,002
【旁白】雨声和水声叠在一起。
(VO) Rain and river-water layer over each other.

2
00:00:03,122 --> 00:00:06,043
【旁白】凿眼。
(VO) He chisels out the eyes.

3
00:00:06,163 --> 00:00:09,085
【旁白】地下河在岩层里奔涌。
(VO) An underground river runs inside the rock.

4
00:00:09,205 --> 00:00:11,127
【旁白】他把凹陷摸了一遍。
(VO) He traces every hollow with his fingers.

5
00:00:11,247 --> 00:00:14,168
【旁白】药藏在油布里。
(VO) The medicine is wrapped in oilcloth.

6
00:00:14,288 --> 00:00:17,210
【旁白】药藏进石缝。
(VO) He hides it in a crack in the stone.

7
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:20,252
【旁白】火光里有一道伤。
(VO) In the firelight, a wound shows.

8
00:00:20,372 --> 00:00:22,293
【旁白】指尖全是石粉。
(VO) His fingertips are white with stone dust.

9
00:00:22,413 --> 00:00:25,335
【旁白】深处有东西在咳。
(VO) Something coughs in the dark behind him.

10
00:00:25,455 --> 00:00:27,377
【旁白】长生秘密。
(VO) The Immortal Secret.

11
00:00:27,497 --> 00:00:30,418
【旁白】吊扇慢转。
(VO) A ceiling fan turns, slow.

12
00:00:30,538 --> 00:00:33,460
系主任：你伯公的地图不能当考古证据。
Dean: Your granduncle's map is not archaeological evidence.

13
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:37,502
系主任：柬埔寨有几千座石庙，每一座都自称藏着高棉王的秘密。
Dean: Cambodia has thousands of stone temples. Each claims the Khmer king's secret.

14
00:00:37,622 --> 00:00:40,543
林：这不是普通地图。
Lin: This is not an ordinary map.

15
00:00:40,663 --> 00:00:44,585
林：您看塔尖的纹样——和崩密列外围的浮雕属同一时期。
Lin: Look at the tower motif—same period as the reliefs outside Beng Mealea.

16
00:00:44,705 --> 00:00:48,627
系主任：崩密列是公共遗址，法国人七十年代就做完全测绘图了。
Dean: Beng Mealea is a public site. The French surveyed it completely in the seventies.

17
00:00:48,747 --> 00:00:51,668
系主任：你拍到的不是什么新东西。
Dean: What you photographed is nothing new.

18
00:00:51,788 --> 00:00:54,710
林：他在信里写：水吼山下有门。
Lin: In the letter he wrote: under Water-Roar Mountain, there is a door.

19
00:00:54,830 --> 00:00:57,752
林：画上的人没有眼睛。药在门后。
Lin: The man in the drawing has no eyes. The medicine is behind the door.

20
00:01:00,913 --> 00:01:04,835
系主任：维舟，你父亲当年也拿过同一份地图来找我申请课题。
Dean: Weizhou—your father once brought me this same map, asking for a grant.

21
00:01:04,955 --> 00:01:07,877
系主任：你们林家的人，喜欢走同一条路。
Dean: You Lins have a habit of walking the same road.

22
00:01:07,997 --> 00:01:10,918
林：所以我才必须把它走完。
Lin: That's why I have to walk it to the end.

23
00:01:11,038 --> 00:01:13,960
系主任：经费没有。假期批两周。别死在雨林里。
Dean: No funding. Two weeks' leave. Don't die in the jungle.

24
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:18,002
系主任：你们家族已经欠那片丛林一条人命了。
Dean: Your family already owes that jungle one life.

25
00:01:18,122 --> 00:01:21,043
【旁白】雨季的村庄。
(VO) A village in the rainy season.

26
00:01:21,163 --> 00:01:24,085
林：你是萨拉？通先生让我来找你。
Lin: You're Sara? Mr. Tong sent me to you.

27
00:01:24,205 --> 00:01:27,127
萨拉：通先生把每个拿旧地图的人都推给我。
Sara: Mr. Tong sends me everyone who shows up with an old map.

28
00:01:27,247 --> 00:01:30,168
林：你怎么知道是旧地图？
Lin: How did you know it was an old map?

29
00:01:30,288 --> 00:01:34,210
萨拉：不然你也不会从金边开六个小时车，来找一个洗泥巴的。
Sara: Otherwise you wouldn't drive six hours from Phnom Penh to find a woman washing mud.

30
00:01:34,330 --> 00:01:37,252
萨拉：两周前来了三个法国人，也找“高棉王的药”。
Sara: Three Frenchmen came two weeks ago. They were looking for the Khmer king's medicine too.

31
00:01:37,372 --> 00:01:40,293
萨拉：他们进山十一天，出来的时候瘦了七公斤。
Sara: They went in for eleven days. They came out seven kilos lighter.

32
00:01:40,413 --> 00:01:42,335
萨拉：你看着还没他们结实。
Sara: You don't even look as strong as they were.

33
00:01:42,455 --> 00:01:45,377
林：我不找药。我找人。
Lin: I'm not looking for medicine. I'm looking for a person.

34
00:01:45,497 --> 00:01:48,418
【旁白】伯公站在石门前。
(VO) Granduncle stands before a stone door.

35
00:01:48,538 --> 00:01:50,460
萨拉：你在这等着。
Sara: Wait here.

36
00:01:50,580 --> 00:01:53,502
【旁白】同一个中国男人。
(VO) The same Chinese man.

37
00:01:53,622 --> 00:01:55,543
林：你认识他？
Lin: You know him?

38
00:01:55,663 --> 00:01:59,585
萨拉：我奶奶说，这个中国人给山里的河取了名字。
Sara: My grandmother said this Chinese man named the river in the mountain.

39
00:01:59,705 --> 00:02:02,627
萨拉：他走进水吼山，再没走出来。
Sara: He walked into Water-Roar Mountain and never walked out.

40
00:02:02,747 --> 00:02:05,668
萨拉：奶奶说，他被河神收去做看门人了。
Sara: Grandmother said the river spirit took him to keep the door.

41
00:02:05,788 --> 00:02:08,710
林：我来带他回家。
Lin: I came to bring him home.

42
00:02:08,830 --> 00:02:11,752
萨拉：带路费五百美元。他睡我哥的吊床。油钱你出。
Sara: Five hundred dollars to guide you. He sleeps in my brother's hammock. You pay for the fuel.

43
00:02:11,872 --> 00:02:14,793
萨拉：太阳下山前，必须到山脊。
Sara: We have to reach the ridge before the sun goes down.

44
00:02:14,913 --> 00:02:17,835
【旁白】山脊又湿又热。
(VO) The ridge is wet and hot.

45
00:02:17,955 --> 00:02:19,877
【旁白】她在路上做记号。
(VO) She marks the trail as they go.

46
00:02:22,038 --> 00:02:23,960
萨拉：听。
Sara: Listen.

47
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:27,002
【旁白】山在咳嗽。
(VO) The mountain coughs.

48
00:02:27,122 --> 00:02:29,043
林：岩石松动？
Lin: Loose rock?

49
00:02:29,163 --> 00:02:33,085
萨拉：奶奶说，山咳嗽的时候，它想吐出来的东西，你最好别接。
Sara: Grandmother said when the mountain coughs, don't catch what it wants to spit out.

50
00:02:33,205 --> 00:02:36,127
林：这是谁摆的？
Lin: Who put this here?

51
00:02:36,247 --> 00:02:40,168
萨拉：奶奶说，是“给山带路的人”摆的——给你这种人带路。
Sara: Grandmother said the ones who lead the mountain—who lead people like you.

52
00:02:40,288 --> 00:02:42,210
【旁白】照片还在包里。
(VO) The photograph is still in the pack.

53
00:02:42,330 --> 00:02:45,252
【旁白】门楣上的眼睛被凿光。
(VO) The eyes on the lintel have been chiseled away.

54
00:02:45,372 --> 00:02:48,293
林：有人动过它。
Lin: Someone's been at it.

55
00:02:48,413 --> 00:02:50,335
萨拉：我在这里等。
Sara: I'll wait here.

56
00:02:50,455 --> 00:02:52,377
林：为什么？
Lin: Why?

57
00:02:52,497 --> 00:02:56,418
萨拉：奶奶说，进去的人，会变成无眼的自己。
Sara: Grandmother said whoever goes in becomes the eyeless version of himself.

58
00:02:56,538 --> 00:02:59,460
萨拉：你夺走它们的，它们就从你身上拿走。
Sara: What you take from them, they take from you.

59
00:02:59,580 --> 00:03:02,502
【旁白】他进门，她不进。
(VO) He goes in. She does not.

60
00:03:02,622 --> 00:03:06,543
【旁白】王坐在水上。
(VO) A king sits upon the water.

61
00:03:06,663 --> 00:03:10,585
林：就是这个……
Lin: This is it…

62
00:03:10,705 --> 00:03:13,627
林：他找到的就是这个。
Lin: This is what he found.

63
00:03:13,747 --> 00:03:16,668
【旁白】夜来得很快。
(VO) Night comes fast.

64
00:03:16,788 --> 00:03:19,710
【旁白】遗迹里只有刷子和流水。
(VO) Inside the ruin: only a brush, and running water.

65
00:03:19,830 --> 00:03:22,752
【旁白】他在清那面墙。
(VO) He cleans the wall.

66
00:03:24,913 --> 00:03:27,835
【旁白】水在石头里吼。
(VO) Water roars inside the stone.

67
00:03:27,955 --> 00:03:30,877
林：这里面有河。水在石壁里吼。
Lin: There's a river in here. The water is roaring in the wall.

68
00:03:30,997 --> 00:03:33,918
林：伯公说的水吼山，石门就该在这条河上面。
Lin: Granduncle's Water-Roar Mountain—the stone door should sit above this river.

69
00:03:34,038 --> 00:03:36,960
萨拉：水在下面，门在上面。你今晚不睡，它也跑不掉。
Sara: Water below, door above. Even if you don't sleep tonight, it isn't going anywhere.

70
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:41,002
【旁白】蜡尽字显，药在纹中，亡者可归。
(VO) When the wax is gone the words appear: the medicine is in the pattern; the dead may return.

71
00:03:44,163 --> 00:03:47,085
【旁白】无眼的人会记住你。
(VO) The eyeless ones will remember you.

72
00:03:50,247 --> 00:03:53,168
【旁白】金隅粉·皇家军医研究所。
(VO) Jin-corner powder. Royal Military Medical Institute.

73
00:03:53,288 --> 00:03:56,210
【旁白】来电显示林维舟。
(VO) Incoming call: Lin Weizhou.

74
00:03:59,372 --> 00:04:03,293
巴瑟：维舟？丛林里信号不好，我一直在等你消息。
Baset: Weizhou? Signal's bad in the jungle. I've been waiting to hear from you.

75
00:04:03,413 --> 00:04:07,335
林（电话）：巴瑟老师，我找到了。
Lin (phone): Teacher Baset—I found it.

76
00:04:07,455 --> 00:04:11,377
林（电话）：石门和铭文字迹完全一致，地下有暗河。
Lin (phone): The stone door matches the inscription exactly. There's an underground river.

77
00:04:11,497 --> 00:04:14,418
林（电话）：请帮我在官方备个案，越快越好。
Lin (phone): Please file it officially. The sooner the better.

78
00:04:14,538 --> 00:04:17,460
巴瑟：你把坐标发我，我来处理。
Baset: Send me the coordinates. I'll handle it.

79
00:04:17,580 --> 00:04:19,502
林（电话）：谢谢老师。等我回去，拓片先带给您看。
Lin (phone): Thank you. When I get back, I'll bring you the rubbing first.

80
00:04:19,622 --> 00:04:22,543
【旁白】他没有放下瓶子。
(VO) He never puts the bottle down.

81
00:04:22,663 --> 00:04:25,585
【旁白】坐标将出门。
(VO) The coordinates are about to leave the room.

82
00:04:25,705 --> 00:04:28,627
【旁白】曼谷军方夜。
(VO) Bangkok. A military night.

83
00:04:28,747 --> 00:04:31,668
【旁白】坐标写在照片旁。
(VO) The coordinates sit beside a photograph.

84
00:04:31,788 --> 00:04:35,710
颂猜：这个坐标在四十年前美军地图上出现过，代号DAV-7。
Somchai: This point was on a U.S. map forty years ago. Codename DAV-7.

85
00:04:35,830 --> 00:04:38,752
【旁白】他在看那排黑洞。
(VO) He looks at the row of black hollows.

86
00:04:40,913 --> 00:04:44,835
颂猜：一个中国教授，拿一张六十年前的地图，找到美军当年用卫星才标到的东西。
Somchai: A Chinese professor, with a sixty-year-old map, found what the U.S. Army needed satellites to mark.

87
00:04:44,955 --> 00:04:46,877
颂猜：不要惊动柬埔寨。
Somchai: Don't alert Cambodia.

88
00:04:46,997 --> 00:04:49,918
颂猜：去请巴瑟教授喝杯咖啡。
Somchai: Go ask Professor Baset for a cup of coffee.

89
00:04:50,038 --> 00:04:53,960
颂猜：他女儿在皇家医院的手术，我们帮了很大的忙。该还一还了。
Somchai: We helped a great deal with his daughter's surgery at the Royal Hospital. Time he paid that back.

90
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:57,002
【旁白】他也到过这扇门。
(VO) He has been to this door too.

91
00:04:57,122 --> 00:05:00,043
【旁白】下集：穿靴的人。
(VO) Next episode: The Men in Boots.

